##### 证明

由：

```math
D_aD_b=S_{a,b}+H_{a,b},
```

以及：

```math
p_{\kappa'}-p_\kappa
=
(\kappa'-\kappa)d,
```

得到：

```math
\begin{aligned}
&R(D_aD_b p_{\kappa'})
-
R(D_aD_b p_\kappa)
\\
&=
R\bigl(D_aD_b(p_{\kappa'}-p_\kappa)\bigr)
\\
&=
(\kappa'-\kappa)R(D_aD_bd)
\\
&=
(\kappa'-\kappa)
R\bigl((S_{a,b}+H_{a,b})d\bigr)
\\
&=
(\kappa'-\kappa)
\left(
\Sigma_{a,b}+\mathcal H_{a,b}
\right).
\end{aligned}
```

证毕。

